{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45292","headline":"咏史 · 皎然","name":"咏史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"田氏门下客，冯公衆中贱。\n一朝市义还，百代名独擅。\n始知下客不可轻，能使主人功业成。\n借问高车与珠履，何如卑贱一书生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45292.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45292","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「咏史」条，撰者李坤栋、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"李坤栋"}